	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_hero_2">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おびえるしみん『キャーッ！！
ＯＬの　ばけものが　でたーっ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-27T05:44:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-27T05:44:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おびえる市民『キャーッ！！
ＯＬの　化け物が　でたーっ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-27T05:44:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
